WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.710
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.770
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.900
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:34.240
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.460
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.570
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.050
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.050
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.430
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.890
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:16.660
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.410
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.920
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:41.700
It's been a long time since I drank Ella's coffee.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:46.960
No matter where in the world you go, you won't find coffee this delicious.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:55.420
Now I want you to explain who Chaos is.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:57.760
I'd like to know myself.

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:01.930
It seems Eggman is up to no good again.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:07.600
I never thought he'd go after the Master Emerald.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:09.350
I let my guard down.

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:14.980
Master Emerald? Isn't that the object you were protecting in your world, Knuckles?

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:19.320
That's right. That Master Emerald was destroyed!

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:56.030
Who are you?

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.530
The Master Emerald!

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:07.660
Did you do that?

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:20.220
Wait!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:24.390
Damn! Who was that?

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:26.810
It's started.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:36.690
When the Master Emerald loses its power, this island sinks.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.920
Chaos destroyed the Master Emerald?

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:58.210
Big, didn't you say Chaos also appeared before you?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.740
What's wrong, Froggy?

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:38.790
Why do you have a tail?

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:51.520
Froggy swallowed my treasure.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:52.600
Treasure?

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:58.360
A big and very beautiful purple stone.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.440
You mean a Chaos Emerald?

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:05.610
If we don't find that frog quickly, it will be in danger.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:06.950
Why?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:11.330
Eggman is also looking for the Chaos Emeralds.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:15.960
He needs them to transform that fiend into the ultimate monster.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.220
Go ahead and shoot!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.350
It’s not working.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:38.900
It's unbelievable.

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:57.290
We must gather the Chaos Emeralds before Eggman!

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.540
Okay, leave it to me.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.340
Do you know where they are?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.090
If I run around, I'll eventually bump into them.

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:07.170
I'm going to search for shards of the Master Emerald.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.550
Then Big, you and I will search for Froggy.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:13.600
Okay.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:24.360
Sonic and the others can handle this. Everything will be fine.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.820
I'm still worried.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.110
Don't worry.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:35.720
Episode 28

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:35.720
The Mysterious Liquid Life Form, Chaos

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.020
Hey.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.480
Sonic!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.900
I see. You're going to collect the Chaos Emeralds again.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:11.660
Let's ask around. I'm counting on you, Tails.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:15.700
I think I can already help you.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:18.870
Ta-daa!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.590
I randomly found it the other day.

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:31.180
If we search for locations that resonate with it, we'll find the other Chaos Emeralds.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.010
Okay, let's get going!

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.690
Alright, here we go.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:11.220
What happened?

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:13.760
Knuckles!

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:18.510
What? You mean the one who did a terrific job in the previous fight against Eggman?

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.270
Never mind that.

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:22.890
Did that monster do that?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:27.360
No. A shiny object fell from the sky.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.230
What? Is that true?

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:30.650
Yes...

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.370
Master Emerald...

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.530
Where am I?

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.820
Wait, I know. I know where I am.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:20.490
Please don't do it!

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:31.460
Tikal, we need the seven emeralds for our country to thrive.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.710
You still haven't had enough?

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:39.300
Invading other countries to steal and hurt people…

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.350
I'm tired of all that!

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:46.520
Father, no one has the right to take away their livelihood!

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.610
Are you all right?

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.240
Yeah.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.040
Please take that shard with you, Knuckles. Right?

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.040
Yeah, that would be good.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:10.460
Let me know if you find anything similar.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:15.800
What's going on?

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.690
It's a signal for a Chaos Emerald.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.900
Over there.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.410
Tails!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.000
Are you all right?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:51.380
Yeah. The air is very turbulent.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.800
It's resonating.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:01.550
This must be the place.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.960
Chaos Emerald.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.290
Yes!

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:42.760
Let's keep this up and find the others, Sonic.

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:43.760
Yeah!

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:47.600
Not again!

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.100
It's different this time.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:10.540
Thanks for digging out the Chaos Emeralds for me.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.960
You were following us the entire time!

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:17.790
Hurry up and find the next Emerald. See ya!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:18.960
Wait!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.850
How annoying!

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.890
Take this! And this! And this!

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.060
So annoying!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.060
Full power!

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.400
Sonic!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.030
Got it!

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.880
Why?

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.720
The Chaos Emeralds!

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.690
Come out, Chaos 4!

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.950
It evolved?

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:28.660
Oh gosh...

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:52.600
Stay back, Tails!

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.080
He did it!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.520
Sonic!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:46.490
Good! Drown him!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.290
It's the air turbulence.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:08.800
What?

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.980
You finished it off this time for sure!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.770
Hey, guys! I'll play with you again sometime!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.480
How dare you!

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:36.030
You haven't seen the full power of Chaos yet!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.950
Just wait, Sonic!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.330
Stop!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:56.810
How do you like my air fortress Egg Carrier?

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:09.990
If I only held the Chaos Emeralds more tightly…

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.150
I'm sorry, Sonic.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.360
Never mind.

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:15.740
Let's hurry up and go after him.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.460
It suddenly became cloudy.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:31.800
The weather forecast didn't say it was going to rain. This is bad.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.440
Sonic.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.400
We won't let you get away.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.830
How annoying!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.590
I won't let that beat me!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:20.470
Go!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:37.450
Is that really Eggman? That's trouble!

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.670
Ouch! That came out of nowhere!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:55.340
Are you hurt? Are you okay?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.260
Nice, Tails!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.100
Let's keep going!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.730
Don't think you've won yet.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.060
Ready the Eggman Cannon!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:11.610
Aye, aye sir. The cannon energy is fully charged.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:15.240
Anti-shock, anti-flash and barrier shield are ready!

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:18.030
Fire the Eggman Cannon!

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.620
We're hit!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.880
Sonic!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:53.520
Sonic!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:16.760
Sonic!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.010
You fly the plane.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.680
And what about you, Sonic?

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.560
Much better.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.350
What are we going to do?

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:33.810
Charge into them!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.400
Right...

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:39.690
As long as I'm with Sonic, I'm not afraid of anything!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:53.170
That was a nostalgic dream.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.340
This is...

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.340
Chris's house.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.760
You regained consciousness.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.390
I…

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.470
Where's Sonic?

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:12.350
He's fine. Amy saw you two falling and contacted me.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.990
He causes such a scene.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:37.000
The X-Tornado was also badly damaged.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.590
But we won't give up!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.970
When we lose, we'll pay them back in double!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.090
That's the spirit!

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:46.180
Yeah!

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:49.390
The town is in a panic.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:53.100
I hope Amy and the others are not caught in the crowd.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.980
I'll go check on them.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:06.660
Sonic and Tails have to eat lots of nutritious food so that they can become healthy.

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:11.620
Yes. I started learning how to cook from Ella.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:15.120
Okay, the two of us will do the best we can!

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:21.170
Sorry. I forgot to include you, Cheese. The three of us.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:27.140
Thank goodness you weren't badly hurt.

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:31.310
Birdie, where did you come from? What's your name?

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.690
I wonder what it wants to say.

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.310
I don't know.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:42.110
It's inconvenient if you don't have a name.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:45.200
Okay! How about the name Lily?

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.780
It seems to like the name.

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:51.280
Hi, Lily.

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:57.170
You seem lost, so I hope I can get you back to your flock.

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:01.920
Target detected.

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:03.840
What is that?

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:10.850
Amy!

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:18.650
Let me go!

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:21.110
Somebody, please help us!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.780
Amy!

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:26.740
Sonic!

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:30.990
Mission complete.

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:37.710
Amy!

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.210
Sonic!

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:31.090 --> 00:25:35.430
Amy the Captive
